Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.02,0:01:36.03,staff,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(800,800)}本字幕由{\c&HFFABFC&}桜{\c&HFFFFFF&}都字幕組制作 僅供交流試看之用 請於下載後24小時內刪除
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.03,0:01:39.03,staff,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}翻譯:懶源 掛件 燕燈 時軸:VV 校對:小恐龍 壓製:晚辭秋
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.60,0:00:03.18,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur3}それじやはじめましょう
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.29,0:00:05.00,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur3}甘い応酬浴びせ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:08.29,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur3}混ざらない天使と悪魔ダメっばいな
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.34,0:00:10.04,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur3}頭リセットOK
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.04,0:00:14.38,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur3}視線も心もいっそ手なずけてしまおう
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.50,0:00:25.27,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur3}それじやはじめましょう
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.27,0:00:26.93,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur3}この気持ちの正体
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.93,0:00:30.13,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur3}そのくらい小学生だってわかるわ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.24,0:00:32.01,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur3}事欠いてプランはなし
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.01,0:00:34.55,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur3}もどかしい曖昧さ愚痴って
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.55,0:00:37.31,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur3}目の前は目の前はじれったいや
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.74,0:00:38.22,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur3}ナイス!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.38,0:00:39.85,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur3}まだまだだけど
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.03,0:00:41.46,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur3}派手に決めるタイプ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.74,0:00:44.92,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur3}神の使いにあやかってラック
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.09,0:00:46.61,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur3}極めちやえばどう?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.80,0:00:49.10,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur3}ハテナは直感でかわし
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.31,0:00:51.21,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur3}想いかますの
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.96,0:00:56.01,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur3}浄土の天使はねえここですか?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.10,0:00:57.71,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur3}悪魔はここですか?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.78,0:01:00.63,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur3}裏腹な気持ち困ってんぞ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.72,0:01:02.86,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur3}過度な恋の刺激も限界!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.86,0:01:07.31,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur3}あきらかにまたド一パミン溢れて眠れない
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.43,0:01:09.48,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur3}生命のなんたらかんたらだって
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.63,0:01:11.20,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur3}難しい事だって
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.31,0:01:14.98,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur3}なんにも入って来やしない正直ああ!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.33,0:01:19.28,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur3}尊いくらいやんちゃして飛ばせ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.28,0:01:21.69,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur3}はねたい鼓動
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.60,0:00:03.18,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur2}那麼讓我們開始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.29,0:00:05.00,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur2}將你洗禮於甘甜的褒獎中
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:08.29,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur2}湊不到一起的天使和惡魔看起來真不行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.34,0:00:10.04,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur2}大腦已經設置好了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.04,0:00:14.38,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur2}乾脆把視線和心思一塊馴服了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.50,0:00:25.27,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur2}那麼讓我們開始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.27,0:00:26.93,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur2}這個感覺的真面目
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.93,0:00:30.13,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur2}就連小學生都知道吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.24,0:00:32.01,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur2}不做什麼計劃
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.01,0:00:34.55,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur2}嘴裡焦急且含糊的嘟噥
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.55,0:00:37.31,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur2}這場景這場景看得人急死啦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.74,0:00:38.22,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur2}很好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.38,0:00:39.85,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur2}雖然還不夠好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.03,0:00:41.46,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur2}是用花俏手段解決的類型
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.74,0:00:44.92,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur2}是被天使選中的幸運兒
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.09,0:00:46.61,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur2}究竟如何呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.80,0:00:49.10,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur2}靠直覺來改變疑惑
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.31,0:00:51.21,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur2}能創造出回憶嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.96,0:00:56.01,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur2}這裡是沒有天使的淨土嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.10,0:00:57.71,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur2}惡魔在這裡嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.78,0:01:00.63,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur2}不明不白地讓我摸不著頭腦啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.72,0:01:02.86,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur2}戀愛過盛的刺激也到臨界點了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.86,0:01:07.31,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur2}公開戀情的多巴胺讓人悸動地睡不著
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.43,0:01:09.48,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur2}生命什麼亂七八糟的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.63,0:01:11.20,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur2}還有很難的事什麼的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.31,0:01:14.98,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur2}說真的好希望它們都別來煩我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.33,0:01:19.28,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur2}將貴重的事物一併拋開
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.28,0:01:21.69,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur2}這心臟在悸動
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.61,0:22:18.07,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur4}例えばもしも君の　側にいられるのなら
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.42,0:22:22.46,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur4}叶わないと　気づいていても
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.61,0:22:25.08,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur4}影を探してる
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.49,0:22:26.83,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur4}何処へ行こう?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.80,0:22:30.36,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur4}何処まで行こう?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.74,0:22:35.64,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur4}放課後の長い道で
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.09,0:22:39.16,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur4}何故か寂しくなるのは
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.53,0:22:41.84,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur4}さよならをして
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.04,0:22:43.66,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur4}一人になって
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.80,0:22:47.73,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur4}足音聞こえないから
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.65,0:22:51.54,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur4}応えなんて　要らないけど
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.73,0:22:53.29,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur4}聞いてよ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.69,0:22:55.95,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur4}叶わないかな?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.17,0:22:57.66,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur4}遅いかな?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.91,0:23:01.25,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur4}許してくれるかな?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.25,0:23:04.57,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur4}いつも君のことを歌ったよ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.70,0:23:09.20,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur4}幸せを描いてきたよ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.38,0:23:15.21,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur4}溢れたその笑顔に　幾つ救われてきたのだろう?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.34,0:23:18.70,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur4}生きて歩く意味をもらったよ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.85,0:23:23.32,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur4}力を受け取ってきたよ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.51,0:23:28.92,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur4}ありがとうは少しだけ　寄り道してから
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.00,0:23:30.33,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur4}伝えるね
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.55,0:23:34.79,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur4}君の好きな　私だから
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.96,0:23:38.89,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur4}私も好きになれたよ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.61,0:22:18.07,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur3}如果 我能待在你的身旁
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.42,0:22:22.46,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur3}哪怕意識到這無法實現
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.61,0:22:25.08,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur3}也仍在尋找你的影子
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.49,0:22:26.83,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur3}你要去哪裡?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.80,0:22:30.36,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur3}你要去多遠?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.74,0:22:35.64,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur3}放學後的漫漫長路上
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.09,0:22:39.16,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur3}我之所以不由得感到寂寞
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.53,0:22:41.84,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur3}是因為說著再見
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.04,0:22:43.66,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur3}逐漸變成一人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.80,0:22:47.73,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur3}聽不見大家的腳步聲
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.65,0:22:51.54,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur3}雖然不需要回應
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.73,0:22:53.29,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur3}但請聽我說
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.69,0:22:55.95,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur3}期待能實現嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.17,0:22:57.66,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur3}是否太遲了?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.91,0:23:01.25,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur3}你會原諒我嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.25,0:23:04.57,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur3}我一直歌唱著你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.70,0:23:09.20,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur3}又描繪著幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.38,0:23:15.21,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur3}又有多少次 被你溢出的笑容所救贖
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.34,0:23:18.70,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur3}你給了我活著走下去的意義
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.85,0:23:23.32,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur3}我也獲得了力量
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.51,0:23:28.92,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur3}雖然有些繞遠 但我要對你說
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.00,0:23:30.33,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur3}說一聲謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.55,0:23:34.79,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur3}多謝有你喜歡我
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.96,0:23:38.89,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord4\blur3}我也得以喜歡上了你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
